        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ash olive pomace, to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ash olive pomace, to landfarming
Ash composition data completed with the ecoinvent inventory of "disposal, wood ash mixture, pure, 0% water, to landfarming";
UUID: e8b0678a-4205-410b-bb0a-0c4aab1b1cbe
This data set describes the disposal of the ash, only spreading of the ash is included (no transport)
Location: The inventory is modelled for a typical production area for olives in the Lythrodontas region in Cyprus.
Technology: none
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: ash composition estimated with data for wood ash
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e8b0678a-4205-410b-bb0a-0c4aab1b1cbe.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
